  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "都市設計概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO URBAN DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "藉由理論與實務案例並重的學習歷程，為學習者建立都市設計專業領域相關理論的基礎知識、培養進行都市觀察、都市議題研析、都市設計課題的診斷的能力、使其具備應用都市設計相關理論、方法與實務技術進行策略性思辨、論述、與提案的專業素養。",
    "describe_eh": "Through a learning process that emphasizes both theory and practical cases, this course aims at helping students to establish a basic knowledge of urban design and its related theories, cultivate the ability to conduct urban observations, research and analysis and diagnosis of urban problems, so that they can develop their attainment for applying urban design-related theories, methods and practical technics in making strategic thinking, arguments, and proposals upon urban design issues.",
    "pre_subname": "ARCH4101都市計畫學",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ARCH4101",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ARCH4101 URBAN PLANNING",
